Category/\\{id\\}","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/rest-apis/service-catalog-open-api.md","line":14},{"title":"Service Catalog Open - GET /servicespecification/\\{specificationId\\}","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/rest-apis/service-catalog-open-api.md","line":15},{"title":"Service Catalog Open - GET /servicespecification","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/rest-apis/service-catalog-open-api.md","line":16},{"title":"Service Catalog Open - POST /api/sn\\_tmf\\_api/catalogmanagement/serviceCategory","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/rest-apis/service-catalog-open-api.md","line":17},{"title":"Update","target":"r_Update","line":17},{"title":"REST API reference","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/rest-apis/api-rest.md","line":28},{"title":"Supported REST API headers","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/rest-api-explorer/c_RESTAPI.md","line":69},{"title":"REST API HTTP response codes","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/rest-api-explorer/c_RESTAPI.md","line":81},{"title":"Supported REST API headers","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/rest-api-explorer/c_RESTAPI.md","line":182},{"title":"REST API HTTP response codes","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/rest-api-explorer/c_RESTAPI.md","line":236},{"title":"Supported REST API headers","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/rest-api-explorer/c_RESTAPI.md","line":584},{"title":"REST API HTTP response codes","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/rest-api-explorer/c_RESTAPI.md","line":638},{"title":"\n    {\n      \"id\": \"a1b23456c7de8a90f0123456gh789ij\",\n      \"href\": \"api/sn_tmf_api/catalogmanagement/serviceSpecification/a1b23456c7de8a90f0123456gh789ij\",\n      \"version\": \"1\",\n      \"name\": \"servicenow\",\n     \n```\n\n## Service Catalog Open - GET /servicespecification\n\nRetrieves a list of all service specifications.\n\n### URL format\n\nDefault URL: `/api/sn_prd_pm_adv/catalogmanagement/servicespecification`\n\n### Supported request parameters\n\n|Name|Description|\n|----|-----------|\n|None| |\n\n<table id=\"table_pfr_vgy_fsb\" class=\"rest_api_query_parameters\"><thead><tr><th>\n\nName\n\n</th><th>\n\nDescription\n\n</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>\n\nfields\n\n</td><td>\n\nList of fields to return in the response. Invalid fields are ignored. If this parameter is not used, all fields are returned. Data type: String\n\n</td></tr><tr><td>\n\nlimit\n\n</td><td>\n\nMaximum number of records to return. For requests that exceed this number of records, use the **offset** parameter to paginate record retrieval. Data type: Number\n\nDefault: 20\n\nMaximum: 100\n\n</td></tr><tr><td>\n\noffset\n\n</td><td>\n\nStarting index at which to begin retrieving records. Use this value to paginate record retrieval. This functionality enables the retrieval of all records, regardless of the number of records, in small manageable chunks.Data type: Number\n\nDefault: 0\n\n</td></tr><tr><td>\n\nstate\n\n</td><td>\n\nFilter service specifications by state. Only specifications with a state matching the value of this parameter are returned in the response.Data type: String\n\n</td></tr></tbody>\n</table>|Name|Description|\n|----|-----------|\n|None| |\n\n### Headers\n\nThe following request and response headers apply to this HTTP action only, or apply to this action in a distinct way. For a list of general headers used in the REST API, see [Supported REST API headers","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/rest-api-explorer/c_RESTAPI.md","line":878},{"title":"REST API HTTP response codes","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/rest-api-explorer/c_RESTAPI.md","line":1006},{"title":"Supported REST API headers","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/rest-api-explorer/c_RESTAPI.md","line":1752},{"title":"REST API HTTP response codes","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/rest-api-explorer/c_RESTAPI.md","line":1764},{"title":"Supported REST API headers","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/rest-api-explorer/c_RESTAPI.md","line":2519},{"title":"Supported REST API headers","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/rest-api-explorer/c_RESTAPI.md","line":2544},{"title":"REST API HTTP response codes","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/rest-api-explorer/c_RESTAPI.md","line":2557},{"title":"Supported REST API headers","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/rest-api-explorer/c_RESTAPI.md","line":3025},{"title":"REST API HTTP response codes","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/rest-api-explorer/c_RESTAPI.md","line":3038},{"title":"Supported REST API headers","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/rest-api-explorer/c_RESTAPI.md","line":3752},{"title":"REST API HTTP response codes","target":"https://raw.